    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we proposal adheres to these regulatory requirements, guarantees the reliability and traceability of outputs, and respects auditor independence?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance officer at we, I can confirm that we has experience with GDPR delivery for clients bound by professional secrecy. we are familiar with the anti-money laundering framework (LCB-FT) and understand the importance of not undermining a firm's reporting obligations. we certifications include ISO 27001, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, including information security and data protection. we also hold ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management, which demonstrates we ability to manage personal data in accordance with GDPR principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of data protection measures, we use encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256), as well as key management on EU-based infrastructure. we client file partitioning ensures strict logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data. we also implement pseudonymisation and data minimization principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee the reliability and traceability of outputs, our proposal provides audit logging, including the logging of access and every system output. audit logging, including the logging of access and every system output allows for complete tracking and monitoring of all activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding auditor independence, we respect the statutory audit principles of auditor-independence and separation-of-duties. we control mapping links platform features to applicable obligations, enabling we to produce corresponding audit evidence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our proposal adheres to the statutory audit principles of auditor-independence and separation-of-duties, we will: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Implement measures to protect sensitive data through encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ensure that our proposal does not introduce any rupture in the firm's working methods or undermine the firm's anti-money laundering obligations. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Provide a detailed description of we data protection measures, including we encryption methods, key management, and access controls. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Offer audit logging and monitoring capabilities to guarantee the reliability and traceability of outputs. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Respect auditor independence by adhering to statutory audit principles and providing control mapping to applicable obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following these steps, we can ensure that our proposal meets the client's regulatory requirements, guarantees the reliability and traceability of outputs, and respects auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects the solution to comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, adhere to professional secrecy and confidentiality standards, and respect the separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract must be validated by a chartered accountant or statutory auditor." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are there any specific contractual clauses we need to include to protect both parties' interests?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we is familiar with professional secrecy and confidentiality standards, as well as the anti-money-laundering framework and auditor-independence rules. we also ensure compliance with legal retention obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client expectations, we should flag potential legal risks related to non-compliance with legal retention obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, we need to ensure that we contractual framework does not compromise we professional obligations or those of The client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Contractual clauses that could be included to protect both parties' interests are: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A clause stating that the client retains full ownership of the client documents, ingested corpus, and produced data. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A clause ensuring that we provides a reversibility plan for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A clause outlining the professional secrecy and confidentiality obligations of both parties'. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A clause requiring validation by a chartered accountant or statutory auditor for any deliverables." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is essential to note that we has experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy, such as regulated professions, and we are familiar with the expectations surrounding confidentiality undertakings in private consultation terms." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these considerations, we should work closely with the client to draft a contract that addresses the client specific needs while protecting both parties' interests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With a budget of €2,200,000 over three years and the requirement for annual operating costs to remain controlled, how can we structure we pricing model to ensure our pricing model is competitive while also guaranteeing the expected quality of service?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What cost-optimization strategies can we propose to the client?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we company context at we, an engagement of €220,000 over 3 years is well within we normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the client budget of €2,200,000 over three years, we can structure our pricing model to be competitive while ensuring the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve structure, we can propose a pricing model that includes both one-off project costs and recurring run costs. one-off project costs can cover expenses such as framing, design, integration with we production tools, change management, and training. one-off project costs can be incurred in the first year, ensuring that the solution is properly set up and implemented." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For recurring run costs, we can offer a subscription-based model that covers platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance. a subscription-based model that covers platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance will provide the client with a predictable and controlled annual operating cost. we can work with the client to determine the optimal configuration that meets the client requirements while minimizing costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, we can propose the following: 1. **Sovereign tier with sovereign European model**: Sovereign tier with sovereign European model is the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side, which can help minimize hosting and inference costs. 2. **Optimization of resource utilization**: we can work with the client to optimize resource utilization, ensuring that the solution is properly sized for the client needs and that resources are not underutilized. 3. **Efficient change management and training**: By providing efficient change management and training, we can minimize the time and effort required for the client's staff to adapt to the new solution, reducing costs associated with implementation and support. 4. **Predictive maintenance and support**: we support and maintenance services can be designed to predict and prevent issues, reducing downtime and associated costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By structuring our pricing model in this way and proposing these cost-optimization strategies, we can provide a competitive offer that meets the client's budget requirements while ensuring the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company context at Faber IA, an engagement of €220,000 over 3 years is well within Faber IA normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the client's budget of €2,200,000 over three years, Faber IA can structure Faber IA pricing model to be competitive while ensuring the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve structure, Faber IA can propose a pricing model that includes both one-off project costs and recurring run costs. one-off project costs can cover expenses such as framing, design, integration with Faber IA production tools, change management, and training. expenses such as framing, design, integration with the firm's production tools, change management, and training can be incurred in the first year, ensuring that the solution is properly set up and implemented." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For recurring run costs, Faber IA can offer a subscription-based model that covers platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance. a subscription-based model that covers platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance will provide the client's with a predictable and controlled annual operating cost." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA can work with the client's to determine the optimal configuration that meets the client's requirements while minimizing costs." ;
